# spec: GET [1.2] product name is a leading 00 byte, then the name as UTF-8 (NOTES.md, Fargo's read table).
# source: captures/20260404-173258_wind-block.json, snapshot "before" (QC Ultra 2, firmware 8.2.20), [1.2] = 00 "Fargo"
device qc_ultra2
call name
send 01 02 01 00
recv 01 02 03 06 00 46 61 72 67 6f
result ok Fargo
